From 2b6d4789deb036ef507c5790e7c3d9986f8db14a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZeroRaven <amresh.shah@live.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 04:08:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix CI: remove unused shadcn/ui components, unblock
 typecheck gate
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

The CI workflow added in 64e83f5 failed on every push since: tsc --noEmit
type-checks the full shadcn/ui library that a Figma Make export committed,
but package.json only carries dependencies for the 5 components the site
actually uses — 35 unused files failed with 'Cannot find module' (recharts,
react-day-picker, embla-carousel-react, ~24 Radix packages).

- Remove 42 unused src/app/components/ui/* (keep button, card, input,
  label, textarea, utils — the only ones site code imports)
- site.ts: widen the literal phone comparison with String() so the
  demo-contacts dev warning survives strict mode (TS2367)
- ci.yml: ignore <lastmod>-only churn in the sitemap gate (the generator
  date-stamps it, so the old byte-for-byte check failed daily); upgrade
  checkout/setup-node v4 -> v5 and Node 20 -> 24 (EOL April 2026)
- Add npm run prune-ui to re-prune unused ui components after future
  Figma Make exports (dependency-walk based, floor-listed)

Verified: npm ci -> typecheck (0 errors) -> build -> sitemap gate.
