From ff65012696a2bfd501bb4a6afbfdef1cfdf17d78 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ZeroRaven <amresh.shah@live.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 11:07:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Release 11: climate tracker, IPCC methane + milk quality
 tools; SOS square-button root fix; Devanagari typography; new BCS
 illustration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

User-reported fixes:
- Emergency Aid button appeared square on load: the SOS launcher's
  focus-return effect fired on mount (open=false, active=null) and
  focused itself, then a11y.css ':focus-visible { border-radius: 4px }'
  flattened the round shape (unlayered CSS beats layered utilities).
  Fixed both: wasOpenRef guard (also stops the WCAG focus steal) and the
  radius removed from the focus rule (outlines follow element radius).
- Mobile search icon duplicated in navbar + drawer: removed the drawer's
  search row; navbar button + Ctrl+K remain the single entry point.

Typography (Devanagari):
- Blanket letter-spacing reset in NP mode (html.lang-np *) — tracking
  breaks shirorekha linkage in an abugida
- Root size bump to 106.25% (17px) with explicit combined values for the
  a11y font-size modes; dyslexia-mode letter-spacing neutralised while
  keeping its word-spacing/line-height benefit

New tools (facts verified online):
- /tools/climate — 30-yr ERA5 district normals via the Open-Meteo
  archive API: monsoon-window rainfall chart, temperature ranges, recent
  anomalies, 15v15 warming, derived livestock season calendar
- /tools/methane — IPCC 2006 Tier 1 herd CH4 + manure N2O with AR6
  GWPs, per-litre intensity vs FAO GLEAM, editable factors, mitigation
- /tools/milktest — two-axis Fat x SNF pricing, CLR->SNF field formula,
  DDB-style quality grade, daily/monthly earnings

Also: BCS stick-figure replaced with a labelled anatomical line
illustration driven by per-score pose parameters; KB sticky filter
toolbar + reader text-size stepper (persisted); tools registry, search,
SEO (20 tools) and sitemap updated.

Verified: tsc 0 errors, vite build clean, sitemap gate green, live
browser QA at 390px/desktop.
